# Kira Makan environment variables. See DEPLOY.md for the full setup.
#
# Local development: copy this file to .env.local and fill it in.
#   PowerShell: Copy-Item .env.example .env.local
#   Git Bash:   cp .env.example .env.local
# .env.local is git-ignored (*.local) and stays on your computer. Restart `npm run dev` after editing.
#
# Vercel: add only the VITE_SUPABASE_* variables under the project's Environment Variables.
# Everything starting with VITE_ is baked into the public JavaScript at build time, so it must
# never hold a secret.
#
# Without any of these the app works fully offline, with no account and catalogue-only estimates.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Sign-in for AI estimates (Supabase). Public by design; leave empty for the local AI test.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Project URL, no trailing slash: https://<project-ref>.supabase.co
# Supabase dashboard: the Connect button, or Settings > API Keys.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=

# The project's publishable key (sb_publishable_...) or, on older projects, the legacy anon key
# (a long eyJ... key). Both are safe in a browser. Never use a secret or service_role key here.
VITE_SUPABASE_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Where the app sends AI estimates (optional).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# - Local dev without Supabase: /api/estimate. The Vite dev server answers it with
#   ANTHROPIC_API_KEY below, without sign-in.
# - Deployed: leave it unset. With VITE_SUPABASE_URL set, the app uses
#   ${VITE_SUPABASE_URL}/functions/v1/estimate and sends the signed-in user's token.
# - Pointing at another host also needs that host in connect-src in vercel.json.
VITE_ESTIMATE_URL=/api/estimate

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dev server only (server/devEstimatePlugin.ts). Never sent to the browser, never set on Vercel.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Anthropic API key (sk-ant-...) from https://platform.claude.com/settings/keys
# Without it, /api/estimate answers 503 and the app falls back to the offline estimator.
# The deployed function gets its own copy as a Supabase secret (DEPLOY.md part 5).
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
